Hey, I'm Ramyan. I read a lot, regularly watch movies, and have spent far too long building an insurmountable anime backlog. I built this site to express my thoughts and takes on them. Please note I'm not great at writing, but I'm learning and I hope that each review is better and more cohesive than the last. Please reach out if you have suggestions or disagreements.

Ratings are out of five. These entries go up whenever I finish something and feel like I have something to say. There is no schedule. There are eventual plans to extend to games.

Contact me [here](/contact).
